+# C3. cloud_oauth, in-process and as processes. A Python file of test groups,
+# each printing P or F lines, runs in a sandbox with its own pid and network
+# namespaces, so the script's /proc walks and kills and its port binds reach
+# nothing outside it; sysfs, uinput and sway are patched per group, never
+# reached. `drive` runs cloud_oauth's own main() with those patches, for the
+# groups that need a serve as a process of its own.
